<p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>

<p>
  We have your enquiry about how you are set up, and we will pass it to a specialist who
  works in the country you named.
</p>

<p><strong>What happens next</strong></p>
<ul style="padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0 16px">
  <li>We tell you who the specialist is before we pass anything on.</li>
  <li>They contact you directly, under their own terms of engagement.</li>
  <li>Any advice comes from them. <%= appName %> is not an accountant and gives none.</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280">
  We keep your enquiry for <%= retentionDays %> days and then delete it. If you would
  rather we deleted it sooner, reply to this message and say so.
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#6b7280">
  We did not calculate anything for you, and you should be wary of anyone who does before
  knowing your situation: what you keep depends on where you are tax-resident, how you are
  set up, your VAT position and how you pay yourself.
</p>
